  "content": {
    "story_lines": [
      "Kite Day! You carry Nora's",
      "new kite up to the hilltop.",
      "The path splits in three.",
      "",
      "A duck family waddles onto",
      "the little bridge. Your kite",
      "tail dips in the water.",
      "",
      "A baker offers a warm bun.",
      "A lost puppy tugs your",
      "sleeve and whines.",
      "",
      "You squeeze through, and",
      "the kite snags on a thorn.",
      "",
      "",
      "The ducks waddle off. A kid",
      "with no kite smiles at",
      "yours.",
      "",
      "Splash! The ducks scatter",
      "and your kite tail gets",
      "soaked.",
      "",
      "The puppy leads you to a",
      "girl searching for her",
      "pet.",
      "",
      "Yum! But crumbs call the",
      "crows, and one grabs your",
      "kite string!",
      "",
      "RIP. The kite tears right",
      "down the middle.",
      "",
      "",
      "The gardener frees the kite",
      "and gives you a ribbon.",
      "",
      "",
      "At the hill, a happy crowd",
      "has gathered to watch.",
      "",
      "",
      "You reach the hilltop. The",
      "wind is just right.",
      "",
      "",
      "The wind drops and the sun",
      "is low. The festival is",
      "nearly over.",
      "",
      "You head home with the kite",
      "still folded. Maybe next",
      "year.",
      "",
      "Up it goes! The whole hill",
      "cheers as the kite soars.",
      "",
      "",
      "Flop. The kite tumbles into",
      "a bush and the lanterns",
      "go out.",
      "",
      "A neighbour lends a big",
      "breeze-catcher. Together",
      "you fly it high!",
      "",
      "A big gust! The kite pulls",
      "hard on the string, and a",
      "small hand reaches over.",
      "",
      "The string burns your palms",
      "as the kite drags you down",
      "the slope, faster and faster!",
      "",
      "Two small hands, one steady",
      "string. The kite wobbles,",
      "then settles in the wind.",
      ""
    ],
